    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_beit_hakisei_tachtoniyot",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "והמאריך בבית הכסא מעליותא הוא? והתניא: עשרה דברים מביאין את האדם לידי תחתוניות... ויש אומרים: אף התולה עצמו בבית הכסא יותר מדאי -- is prolonging in the privy a virtue?",
     "against": "p_maarich_bebeit_hakisei_arichut_yamim",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_baraita_asara_tachtoniyot",
     "gloss_en": "ten things bring a person to hemorrhoids: eating reed leaves, vine leaves, vine tendrils, an animal's palate, a fish's spine, salted fish not fully cooked; drinking wine lees; wiping with lime or clay; wiping with a pebble another has wiped with"
    }
   ]
  },
